Mark Craddock put them 3 up at Bethel B who fought back through James Smithson only for Nathan Taylor to win the last playing his 2nd game of the evening

Bugle B took 3 points at home to Bethel B as Dave Rundle opened the evening having a 38 break whilst taking out Terry Nicholls Mike Haley levelled things up but Keith Moore regained the lead beating Darren Biggen then Adrian Dyche beat Nigel Couchman on the Black to set up a final frame decider which Colin Rundle won getting past Craig Nicholls in a very high scoring game

